  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.72904" lon="-117.54849">
    <name><![CDATA[Staging Area]]></name>
    <desc><![CDATA[Open area with different trail options. ]]></desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.86451" lon="-117.67392">
    <name><![CDATA[Fork, pay attention]]></name>
    <desc><![CDATA[Initially we turned Left (red) and went down to the gate. It's locked, so we had to come back up to this point and follow the (blue) path out. If the gates on both are locked, you will have to backtrack. The blue trail is open]]></desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.8491" lon="-117.65327">
    <name><![CDATA[Security Gate]]></name>
    <desc><![CDATA[This is locked, and you must drive around it, or cut the corner. The corner was a little steep and dicey. I suggest going around.]]></desc>
  </wpt>
